      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    months = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n    stock_prices = [150, 155, 147, 160, 166]\n    n = len(months)\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    sum_x = sum(months)\n    sum_y = sum(stock_prices)\n    sum_xy = sum(x * y for x, y in zip(months, stock_prices))\n    sum_x_squared = sum(x ** 2 for x in months)\n\n    slope = (\n        (n * sum_xy - sum_x * sum_y)\n        / (n * sum_x_squared - sum_x ** 2)\n    )\n    answer = round(slope, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
